  "bio": "Embark on a unique ink journey at Cold Desert Tattoo, where creativity flows like paint on a canvas. Specializing in vibrant watercolor and dynamic newschool styles, our artists transform your vision into a living masterpiece. Visit us at our WM & Monroe, LA locations, and experience a boutique atmosphere that blends artistic flair with personalized care—call 318-654-7640 to book your session or connect with us on Facebook!\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nWe are a custom tattoo studio in WM & Monroe, LA 318-654-7640. 5266 Cypress Street (off Well Road) & 3223 Louisville in Monroe. Like us on Facebook!",
